LL(1) gramatika pre jazyk IFJ25
Štartovací symbol: Program

# End / special
TOKEN_EOF
TOKEN_ERROR
TOKEN_NEW_LINE

# Identifiers
TOKEN_IDENTIFIER          # e.g., local identifier
TOKEN_GLOBAL_ID           # e.g., @global / special id (as defined by lexer)

# Literals
TOKEN_INTEGER
TOKEN_INTEGER_EXP         # integer with exponent form, if supported
TOKEN_FLOAT
TOKEN_FLOAT_EXP           # float with exponent form
TOKEN_HEXA                # hexadecimal integer
TOKEN_STRING
TOKEN_STRING_BLOCK        # multi-line / block string literal
TOKEN_TRUE
TOKEN_FALSE

# Keywords
TOKEN_KEYWORD_IF
TOKEN_KEYWORD_ELSE
TOKEN_KEYWORD_WHILE
TOKEN_KEYWORD_FOR
TOKEN_KEYWORD_RETURN
TOKEN_KEYWORD_VAR

# Operators
TOKEN_PLUS                # +
TOKEN_MINUS               # -
TOKEN_DOUBLE_MINUS        # --
TOKEN_STAR                # *
TOKEN_SLASH               # /
TOKEN_ASSIGN              # =
TOKEN_EQ                  # ==
TOKEN_LT                  # <
TOKEN_GT                  # >
TOKEN_LTE                 # <=
TOKEN_GTE                 # >=
TOKEN_NOT                 # !
TOKEN_AND                 # &&
TOKEN_OR                  # ||

# Delimiters / punctuation
TOKEN_LPAREN              # (
TOKEN_RPAREN              # )
TOKEN_SQUARE_LEFT         # [
TOKEN_SQUARE_RIGHT        # ]
TOKEN_DOT                 # .
TOKEN_DOUBLE_DOT          # ..
TOKEN_QUESTION_MARK       # ?
TOKEN_BLOCK_START         # {
TOKEN_BLOCK_END           # }


Program -> Prolog Main_class
Prolog -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_IMPORT TOKEN_STRING("ifj25") TOKEN_KEYWORD_FOR TOKEN_KEYWORD_IFJ  ##### Syntakticka chyba 2
Main_class -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_CLASS TOKEN_IDENTIFIER(Program) Block

Block -> TOKEN_BLOCK_START TOKEN_NEW_LINE Func_list TOKEN_BLOCK_END TOKEN_EOF


Func_list -> Stmt TOKEN_NEW_LINE Func_list | eps

Func_dec -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_STATIC TOKEN_IDENTIFIER TOKEN_LPAREN Param_list TOKEN_RPAREN Block
Param_list -> TOKEN_IDENTIFIER Param_list' | eps
Param_list' -> TOKEN_COMMA ??? TOKEN_IDENTIFIER Param_list' | eps

Stmt -> ... | TOKEN_KEYWORD_RETURN Expr | ....

Expr -> 
